									"name": "signUpResult",
									"documentation": "Analysis trace: MWT-UC1 main step (6) and alternative (5a). Return the existing SignUpResult after the accountExists = false branch attempts Member creation and storage. Success requires verified persistence; a storage failure must be checked before retry or termination. This local return-value name introduces no success field or result code.",
									"source": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC1_287c180e90c7493586715cf690822c18"
									},
									"target": {
