									},
									"documentation": "UC1 step 6 and alternative 4a: display the returned SignUpResult. Success ends registration without automatic login. Failure permits correction and a new user submission; storage errors require verification before retry or termination. Repetition is described in the policy rather than drawn as a separate interaction.",
