	"documentation": "Editable StarUML project containing the UC1 Sign Up use case and one sequence diagram. The sequence diagram presents the main flow with an account-conflict alt fragment; input errors, storage errors and resubmission policies are documented in English below the diagram and in the interaction description. Existing class declarations and operation signatures are preserved.",
